{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Department for Work and Pensions ","tree_line_end":6,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF LEGAL GROUP) ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":7},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":21,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 12 ","tree_line_end":25,"tree_line_start":22},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 35 – June 2017 ","tree_line_end":29,"tree_line_start":26},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":33,"tree_line_start":30},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":37,"tree_line_start":34},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1. This letter provides details on Amendment 35; the changes have already been incorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.  ","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":38},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":48,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2. PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with the amended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain the amendment number in the footer  ","tree_line_end":54,"tree_line_start":49},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":59,"tree_line_start":55},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at: ","tree_line_end":64,"tree_line_start":60},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":69,"tree_line_start":65},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n ","tree_line_end":81,"tree_line_start":70},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":86,"tree_line_start":82},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link: ","tree_line_end":90,"tree_line_start":87},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":94,"tree_line_start":91},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://www.dwp.gov.uk/publications/specialist-guides/decision-makers-guide/\n ","tree_line_end":106,"tree_line_start":95},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":111,"tree_line_start":107},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Note: When printing PDF packages set the print properties to Duplex/Long Edge in order to produce double sided prints. ","tree_line_end":116,"tree_line_start":112},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":121,"tree_line_start":117},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"3. Amendment 35 affects chapters 74, 75 & 76.  The changes  ","tree_line_end":127,"tree_line_start":122},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":130,"tree_line_start":128},{"depth":1,"role":"L","text":"• incorporate memo DMG 25/16 \n• incorporate memo DMG 11/17 \n• make minor and consequential changes ","tree_line_end":149,"tree_line_start":131},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• incorporate memo DMG 25/16 ","tree_line_end":137,"tree_line_start":132},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• incorporate memo DMG 11/17 ","tree_line_end":143,"tree_line_start":138},{"depth":2,"role":"LI","text":"• make minor and consequential changes ","tree_line_end":149,"tree_line_start":144},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":152,"tree_line_start":150},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"4. The last two amendment packages amending Volume 12 were ","tree_line_end":156,"tree_line_start":153},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":161,"tree_line_start":157},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 34 [June 2016] ","tree_line_end":166,"tree_line_start":162},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":171,"tree_line_start":167},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 33 [February 2016] ","tree_line_end":176,"tree_line_start":172},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":181,"tree_line_start":177},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":186,"tree_line_start":182},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"5. For reference purposes Decision Makers may find it useful to retain deleted pages for a short period after the introduction of this package. ","tree_line_end":191,"tree_line_start":187},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":195,"tree_line_start":192},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"6. If using a PDF amendment package remove the sheets as stated in the left hand column of the Remove and Insert table below and insert the new sheets as stated in the right hand column (note the record of amendments at the back of the Volume). ","tree_line_end":201,"tree_line_start":196},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":205,"tree_line_start":202},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":209,"tree_line_start":206},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":213,"tree_line_start":210},{"depth":1,"role":"Table","text":"Remove \nInsert \nChapter 74 \nChapter 74 \n74101 – 74222 (3 pages) \n74101 – 74222 (3 pages) \n74319 – 74400 (9 pages)  \n74319 – 74400 (9 pages) \nChapter 75 \nChapter 75 \n75021 – 75030 (1 page) \n75021 – 75030 (1 page) \n \n \nChapter 76 \nChapter 76 \nContents (1 page) \nContents (1 page) \n76001 – 76999 (2 pages) \n76001 – 76999 (2 pages) \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n ","tree_line_end":382,"tree_line_start":214},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":"Remove \nInsert ","tree_line_end":225,"tree_line_start":217},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Remove ","tree_line_end":221,"tree_line_start":218},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Remove ","tree_line_end":221,"tree_line_start":219},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Insert ","tree_line_end":225,"tree_line_start":222},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Insert ","tree_line_end":225,"tree_line_start":223},{"depth":2,"role":"TR","text":"Chapter 74 \nChapter 74 ","tree_line_end":234,"tree_line_start":226},{"depth":3,"role":"TD","text":"Chapter 74 ","tree_line_end":230,"tree_line_start":227},{"depth":4,"role":"P","text":"Chapter 74 ","tree_line_end":230,"tree_li